{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c755","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0cc-369a-7993-946b-ef774181fd54"},"sequence":517,"recorded_at":1780531400001029,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"c76039bf-a435-41d5-be3c-7dbf6b953ab3","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"c76039bf-a435-41d5-be3c-7dbf6b953ab3","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"c76039bf-a435-41d5-be3c-7dbf6b953ab3"},"call_id":"call_01a0b0cd395e7224bceaa5469a4a35da","text":"Read text file `internal/clonebundle/doc.go`.\n1|package clonebundle\n2|\n3|// This package implements the Section 13.14.1 clone capture contracts:\n4|// Clone Raw Object Manifest 1.0.0, Clone Capture Manifest 1.0.0 (with\n5|// Capture Items, Capture Source Basis, and Capture Boundary), Canonical\n6|// Session 1.0.0, Canonical Event 1.0.0 (with Source Evidence and raw\n7|// references), the NativeIdentity and WorkspaceBinding identities, raw\n8|// evidence descriptor agreement over Section 10.2 Blob Descriptors,\n9|// reverse-DNS extension keys, and immutable source generations.\n10|//\n11|// Authority: relux-works/agent-session-manager-spec@v0.6.0, Sections\n12|// 7.8, 10.2, and 13.14.1 (internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.6.0.md).\n13|//\n14|// Every Decode entry validates a closed shape: exact members, bounded\n15|// scalars, closed vocabularies, sorted-unique order, and self-digest\n16|// agreement. Every Build entry constructs the same bytes\n17|// deterministically: identical inputs produce byte-identical outputs,\n18|// and every Build output decodes clean. Refusals name the offending\n19|// member and never admit a partial object.\n20|//\n21|// Reuse, not fork: Environment Tuples decode through\n22|// sessadapter.DecodeTuple, Blob Descriptors verify through\n23|// canonicaljson.CalculateObjectIdentity plus a local claim comparison\n24|// (never the attesting entry, per the provhost no-attestation bound),\n25|// extension keys admit through\n26|// environ.CheckExtensions, and blob bytes install through\n27|// localstore.ObjectStore.PutBlob. The canonicaljson closed-shape\n28|// registry keeps its rejectUnsupportedImmutableObjectShape rows for\n29|// these schemas (that table's census pins every row, so replacing\n30|// them would fork ownership); this package is the validating owner\n31|// and says so here and in TRACEABILITY.md.\n32|//\n33|// Stated bounds (sibling scope, not waived): per-kind Canonical Event\n34|// payload fact registries beyond the Section 13.14.1 envelope rules\n35|// enforced here; maximal_safe projection gating past the\n36|// raw_complete=false derivation; target-branch (G2) admission beyond\n37|// RefuseUnstableForTarget; capture-plan/capture/normalize adapter\n38|// operation wiring (Section 7.8 bodies stay owned by sessadapter).\n39|// This package performs no durable write itself: blob installation\n40|// delegates to the landed localstore no-replace discipline, and the\n41|// crash/idempotency evidence for that path is cited in\n42|// TRACEABILITY.md.","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
